Color\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg></span>\n              <p class=\"htour__desc\">Every region, no road twice: Chefchaouen, Fes, two deserts (Merzouga and Erg Chigaga), the Dades, Taroudant, Essaouira and a night in the High Atlas.</p>\n              <span class=\"htour__facts\">\n                <span class=\"htour__fact\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21c4-4.5 7-7.6 7-11a7 7 0 10-14 0c0 3.4 3 6.5 7 11z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg><b>Start:</b> Tangier</span>\n                <span class=\"htour__fact\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 21V4\"/><path d=\"M5 4h11l-2 4 2 4H5\"/></svg><b>End:</b> Marrakech</span>\n                <span class=\"htour__fact\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 20c0-3.3 2.7-5 6-5s6 1.7 6 5\"/><path d=\"M16 5.5a3 3 0 010 5.8M17 20c0-2.6-.9-4.2-2.5-5\"/></sv