class=\"htour__fact\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21c4-4.5 7-7.6 7-11a7 7 0 10-14 0c0 3.4 3 6.5 7 11z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg><b>Start:</b> Tangier</span>\n                <span class=\"htour__fact\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 21V4\"/><path d=\"M5 4h11l-2 4 2 4H5\"/></svg><b>End:</b> Marrakech</span>\n                <span class=\"htour__fact\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 20c0-3.3 2.7-5 6-5s6 1.7 6 5\"/><path d=\"M16 5.5a3 3 0 010 5.8M17 20c0-2.6-.9-4.2-2.5-5\"/></svg>Private tour</span>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"htour__cta\">View Details</span>\n            </span>\n          </a></article></li>\n"